  "notes": "The current ministry site (moed.gov.sy) has no pages describing the structure, so older ministry pages are cited through Internet Archive copies. Basic education is grades 1-9 in two cycles (الحلقة الأولى and الثانية), ending with the basic education certificate. Secondary is grades 10-12, ending with the baccalaureate. The cited pages do not give the cycle boundary."
